After the battle, May/Brendan hands you the [[Dowsing Machine|Itemfinder]], a special gadget that allows you to search the surrounding area more thoroughly to discover hidden items! Search the underpass for treasure as you continue on to [[Mauville City]].

==Route 103 (optional)==
Go to the left of the Trick House. Back to {{rt|103|Hoenn}}! This is the eastern side of the route. It won't take you back to [[Oldale Town]] before you earn more [[Badge]]s, but there are a lot of Trainers here. It's a good idea to battle them all— it's excellent training for your upcoming Gym battle.

